Operator Meaning <code>==</code> Equal to <code>!=</code> Not equal <code>&gt;</code> Greater than <code>&lt;</code> Less than <code>&gt;=</code> Greater than or equal to <code>&lt;=</code> Less than or equal to <p>Example:</p> <pre><code>if (a &gt; b) {
    // do something
}
</code></pre>

Operator Meaning <code>&amp;&amp;</code> AND <code>||</code> OR <code>!</code> NOT <p>Example:</p> <pre><code>if (a &gt; b &amp;&amp; b &gt; c) {
    // do something
}
</code></pre>
